# Build artifacts for the hand-written camera-authorization gateway.
# Unlike sci_gateway/c/ (SWIG-generated, so the wrapper itself is also
# regenerable/ignorable) everything here except these artifacts is
# hand-written source and must stay tracked -- so, unlike c/.gitignore's
# "libscicv.*" glob, this does NOT blanket-ignore "libgw_scicv_camera.*"
# (that would also swallow the tracked .h/.hxx/.cpp source files, which
# happen to share the same basename prefix as the built dylib).
libgw_scicv_camera.dylib
libgw_scicv_camera.so
*.o
Makefile
